    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\text { If } \\frac{1}{1^4}+\\frac{1}{2^4}+\\frac{1}{3^4}+\\ldots . . \\infty=\\frac{\\pi^4}{90}, \\\\\n& \\frac{1}{1^4}+\\frac{1}{3^4}+\\frac{1}{5^4}+\\ldots . . \\infty=\\alpha, \\\\\n& \\frac{1}{2^4}+\\frac{1}{4^4}+\\frac{1}{6^4}+\\ldots . \\infty=\\beta,<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>then $\\frac{\\alpha}{\\beta}$ is equal to"
